.dw.com/en/evacuation-from-oleshky-how-are-preparations-going/a-79790001?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A lawyer with the Save Ukraine Foundation, Myroslava Kharchenko, told DW about what has been happening in Russian-occupied Oleshky since a temporary ceasefire brokered by Melania Trump took effect.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>One year on, families seek justice after election violence</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ee6b5c8ef8c2569c0dff4c9ef0e6755f224c98ce4a9a40a7b447fe31ada1fac9</id><updated>2026-10-29T06:02:05Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T16:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/one-year-on-families-seek-justice-after-election-violence/a-79779105--19ee0afa750b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/one-year-on-families-seek-justice-after-election-violence/a-79779105?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">One year after Tanzania's deadly post-election violence, families are still seeking answers. A government inquiry recorded 518 deaths. DW research has documented apparent use of excessive force by security forces.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>What would a new Israeli government mean for Arab neighbors? More of the same is expected, with some small positives predicted.</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a1dc0ba48629c63e711fc36bf240851d8ac18b3976d114973f6fcb7bd45d331d</id><updated>2026-10-29T06:02:05Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T16:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/what-would-a-new-israeli-government-mean-for-arab-neighbors-more-of-the-same-is-expected-with-some-s/a-79788174--4047f4a42d4d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-would-a-new-israeli-government-mean-for-arab-neighbors-more-of-the-same-is-expected-with-some-small-positives-predicted/a-79788174?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A new Israeli government is unlikely to bring big changes on controversial topics like Palestinian statehood and Israeli troops in Lebanon and Syria, experts say. Some small positives may be possible though.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine's Zelenskyy irked by US-Russia-China summit</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:72b34e6a398c17365dbf9c62a4065d0e24c2a68acaac00f1d75a9660ba9b6105</id><updated>2026-10-29T06:02:05Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T15:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-s-zelenskyy-irked-by-us-russia-china-summit/a-79788616--52eeb4f3288e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-s-zelenskyy-irked-by-us-russia-china-summit/a-79788616?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Volodymyr Zelenskyy has voiced his concerns about a probable meeting between the leaders of the US, China and Russia next month. Plus, a localized truce appeared to be holding in the town of Oleshky.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Spanish train crash leaves 68 dead, PM Sanchez declares 3 days of mourning</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:372ca8290417ccd1b6a1829e5002a9c54c71be28b3e51757d926351aff981697</id><updated>2026-10-29T06:02:05Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T14:33:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/spanish-train-crash-leaves-68-dead-pm-sanchez-declares-3-days-of-mourning/live-79785087--27257c567f3f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/spanish-train-crash-leaves-68-dead-pm-sanchez-declares-3-days-of-mourning/live-79785087?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Two high-speed trains carrying hundreds of passengers collided south of Madrid. Spain's transport minister said one of the trains was told to continue its journey despite a "red signal" being in effect.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Is Iran headed to war or peace after Mecca alliance meeting?</t